1300+ 7AB0              .store_cell:
1301+ 7AB0 12               ld   (de), a
1302+ 7AB1 13               inc  de
1303+ 7AB2 0B               dec  bc
1304+ 7AB3 78               ld   a, b
1305+ 7AB4 B1               or   c
1306+ 7AB5 20 B2            jr   nz, .byte_loop
1307+ 7AB7
1308+ 7AB7 DD E1            pop  ix
1309+ 7AB9 C1               pop  bc
1310+ 7ABA D1               pop  de
1311+ 7ABB E1               pop  hl
1312+ 7ABC C9               ret
